![Radio Cámara logo](logo.webp)

I worked as a programmer and technical support within a
multidisciplinary team (designers and IT staff) to build the
“Cámara de Diputados” app, which carried a section for the Chamber of
Deputies' radio and news. The app is available for free on the
Appstore.

